
==============================================================================
  PHASE 1 — Engine default registry
==============================================================================
Build the default registry that the engine ships. Stage 1 ships exactly
four sigils: &n, &word, &rest, &noun. The &noun macro lexicon ships
empty so specimens can fill it in without a collision.

Registry label: "engine-default"  size=4

--- default entries (lexicographic) ---------------------------------------
  &n              class=lambda     phase=match        type=number   lex=—                        params=—              exp=—              prov=engine-default
  &noun           class=macro      phase=bind         type=—        lex=[]                       params=—              exp=—              prov=engine-default
  &rest           class=lambda     phase=match        type=slurp    lex=—                        params=—              exp=—              prov=engine-default
  &word           class=lambda     phase=match        type=word     lex=—                        params=—              exp=—              prov=engine-default

==============================================================================
  PHASE 2 — Specimen-level registry & merge policies
==============================================================================
Specimens declare their own sigils and layer them on top of the engine
default. We exercise all three conflict policies: :error (default),
:overwrite (specimen wins), :keep (engine wins).

Specimen built: label="specimen-cave-life"  size=6

--- specimen entries (lexicographic) --------------------------------------
  &and            class=glue       phase=bind         type=—        lex=—                        params=—              exp=—              prov=specimen-cave-life-stage2-preview
  &color          class=macro      phase=bind         type=—        lex=[red, ochre, white, black] params=—              exp=—              prov=specimen-cave-life
  &fuzzy          class=tag        phase=bind         type=—        lex=—                        params=Dict{String, Any}("metric" => "lev", "max_distance" => 2) exp=—              prov=specimen-cave-life
  &noun           class=macro      phase=bind         type=—        lex=[mammoth, fish, berry, fire, cave] params=—              exp=—              prov=specimen-cave-life
  &urgent         class=tag        phase=bind         type=—        lex=—                        params=—              exp=—              prov=specimen-cave-life
  &Σ_greet        class=procedure  phase=bind         type=—        lex=—                        params=—              exp=Any["hello", "&noun"] prov=specimen-cave-life-stage6-preview

