==============================================================================
  PHASE 3 — Per-class counts and filter discipline
==============================================================================
list_sigils filters by class and/or applies_at, with deterministic
lexicographic ordering. Used by serialization and audit paths.

  class=:lambda     count=3  names=["n", "rest", "word"]
  class=:macro      count=2  names=["color", "noun"]
  class=:tag        count=2  names=["fuzzy", "urgent"]
  class=:glue       count=1  names=["and"]
  class=:functor    count=0  names=String[]
  class=:procedure  count=1  names=["Σ_greet"]

  phase=:bind         count=6  names=["and", "color", "fuzzy", "noun", "urgent", "Σ_greet"]
  phase=:match        count=3  names=["n", "rest", "word"]
  phase=:vote_shape   count=0  names=String[]
