==============================================================================
  PHASE 4 — Pattern parsing battery
==============================================================================
Walk a battery of pattern strings through resolve_sigils_in_pattern.
Stage 1 active classes are :lambda, :macro, :tag. Active phases are
:bind and :match. Patterns referencing reserved classes/phases throw
unless the caller passes allow_reserved=true.

--- 4a. zero-sigil fast path (no &) ---------------------------------------
  pattern="hello world"  refs=0
  pattern="the cat sat on the mat"  refs=0
  pattern="lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"  refs=0
  pattern=""  refs=0

--- 4b. single-sigil patterns ---------------------------------------------
  pattern="I want a &noun"                 refs=1 names=["noun"] classes=[:macro]
  pattern="give me &n apples"              refs=1 names=["n"] classes=[:lambda]
  pattern="say &word now"                  refs=1 names=["word"] classes=[:lambda]
  pattern="tell me &rest"                  refs=1 names=["rest"] classes=[:lambda]

--- 4c. multi-sigil math pattern (canonical) ------------------------------
  pattern="what is &n + &n equal to"           refs=2
      [1] &n  bytes=9..10  type=number
      [2] &n  bytes=14..15  type=number
  pattern="compute &n times &n plus &n"        refs=3
      [1] &n  bytes=9..10  type=number
      [2] &n  bytes=18..19  type=number
      [3] &n  bytes=26..27  type=number
  pattern="&n &n &n &n"                        refs=4
      [1] &n  bytes=1..2  type=number
      [2] &n  bytes=4..5  type=number
      [3] &n  bytes=7..8  type=number
      [4] &n  bytes=10..11  type=number

--- 4d. mixed lambda + macro pattern --------------------------------------
  pattern="I have &n &noun in my cave"     refs=2 classes=[:lambda, :macro]
  pattern="the &color &noun is mine"       refs=2 classes=[:macro, :macro]
  pattern="&n &color &noun please"         refs=3 classes=[:lambda, :macro, :macro]

--- 4e. Greek-letter sigil parsing (Σ_greet is reserved :procedure) -------
  parse_sigil_token("&Σ_greet") = "Σ_greet"
  [pattern uses &Σ_greet (reserved :procedure)] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: sigil &Σ_greet has class :procedure which is reserved for a later stage; Stage 1 only activates classes (:lambda, :mac...
  with allow_reserved=true:
    refs=1 class=procedure expansion=Any["hello", "&noun"]

==============================================================================
  PHASE 5 — Error-path battery (NO SILENT FAILURES)
==============================================================================
Every malformed input throws a typed error. We trigger every documented
path and capture the error type + message for the audit log.

--- 5a. registration: bad name shapes -------------------------------------
  [empty name] threw SigilArgumentError — SigilArgumentError: sigil name must be non-empty (arg=name)
  [leading digit] threw SigilArgumentError — SigilArgumentError: sigil name does not match required pattern (letters/digits/dash/underscore, must start with letter): "1n" (arg=name)
  [space in name] threw SigilArgumentError — SigilArgumentError: sigil name does not match required pattern (letters/digits/dash/underscore, must start with letter): "n n" (arg=name)
  [punctuation in name] threw SigilArgumentError — SigilArgumentError: sigil name does not match required pattern (letters/digits/dash/underscore, must start with letter): "n.x" (arg=name)
  [name carries prefix] threw SigilArgumentError — SigilArgumentError: sigil name does not match required pattern (letters/digits/dash/underscore, must start with letter): "&n" (arg=name)

--- 5b. registration: bad class / phase -----------------------------------
  [unknown class] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: unknown sigil class :nope (allowed: (:lambda, :macro, :tag, :glue, :functor, :procedure)) (field=class)
  [unknown phase] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: unknown applies_at :nope (allowed: (:bind, :match, :vote_shape, :tone, :render, :thesaurus, :drop_table, :inhibit, :rel...

--- 5c. registration: class/field coherence -------------------------------
  [:lambda missing sigil_type] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: :lambda sigil &bad requires sigil_type (e.g. :number, :word, :slurp) (field=sigil_type)
  [:lambda with lexicon] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: :lambda sigil &bad must not carry a lexicon (lexicons are for :macro) (field=lexicon)
  [:macro missing lexicon] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: :macro sigil &bad requires a lexicon (use [] for empty/specimen-overridable) (field=lexicon)
  [:macro with sigil_type] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: :macro sigil &bad must not carry sigil_type (sigil_type is for :lambda) (field=sigil_type)
  [:tag with sigil_type] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: :tag sigil &bad must not carry sigil_type (field=sigil_type)
  [:tag with lexicon] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: :tag sigil &bad must not carry lexicon (field=lexicon)
  [expansion on non-:procedure] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: expansion field is reserved for :procedure class (got class :tag) (field=expansion)

--- 5d. registration: lexicon size and content ----------------------------
  [empty string in lexicon] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: macro lexicon for &bad contains empty string at index 2 (field=lexicon)

--- 5e. collision: default throws, overwrite=true succeeds ----------------
  [collision without overwrite] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: sigil &x already registered (existing class=:tag, provenance="first"); pass overwrite=true to replace (field=name)
  with overwrite=true: provenance now=second

--- 5f. lookup: miss + empty name -----------------------------------------
  [lookup_sigil miss] threw SigilResolutionError — SigilResolutionError: no such sigil in registry "engine-default" (sigil=&definitely_not_there, pattern="")
  [lookup_sigil empty name] threw SigilArgumentError — SigilArgumentError: sigil name must be non-empty (arg=name)

--- 5g. pattern: unknown sigil, reserved gating, oversize -----------------
  [unknown sigil in pattern] threw SigilResolutionError — SigilResolutionError: no such sigil in registry "engine-default" (sigil=&nope, pattern="what about &nope here")
  [reserved :glue in pattern] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: sigil &and has class :glue which is reserved for a later stage; Stage 1 only activates classes (:lambda, :macro, :tag) ...
  [pattern over MAX_SIGILS_PER_PATTERN cap] threw SigilConfigError — SigilConfigError: pattern contains more than MAX_SIGILS_PER_PATTERN=64 sigil tokens; pattern="&n + &n + &n + &n + &n + &n + &n + &n + &n ...

--- 5h. list_sigils: bad filter values ------------------------------------
  [list_sigils class filter unknown] threw SigilArgumentError — SigilArgumentError: filter class :nope is not a known SIGIL_CLASSES value (arg=class)
  [list_sigils phase filter unknown] threw SigilArgumentError — SigilArgumentError: filter applies_at :nope is not a known SIGIL_APPLIES_AT value (arg=applies_at)

--- 5i. merge_registry!: bad conflict policy ------------------------------
  [merge_registry! bad policy] threw SigilArgumentError — SigilArgumentError: conflict policy must be :error, :overwrite, or :keep (got :nope) (arg=conflict)

